<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<mdclass:FunctionalOption xmlns:mdclass="http://g5.1c.ru/v8/dt/metadata/mdclass" uuid="87184b9e-90d1-49a6-9ac3-33194795a49e">
  <name>ControlRemainingGTDUponPurchaseOfSupplierAccordingToSchemeProductsOnWay</name>
  <synonym>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>Control remaining CCD numbers while purchasing goods from the vendor using the &quot;goods in transit&quot; scheme </value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>کنترل شماره‌های CCD باقی‌مانده هنگام خرید کالا از تأمین‌کننده با طرح &quot;کالاهای در راه&quot;</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Controllare i saldi dei numeri della polizza di carico doganale all'acquisto dal fornitore secondo lo schema&quot;merci in corso&quot;</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Kontroluj ostatki numerów TDC przy zakupie u dostawcy według schematu &quot;wiersze pozycji w drodze&quot;</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Контролировать остатки номеров ГТД при закупке у поставщика по схеме &quot;товары в пути&quot;</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>Tedarikçiden satın alırken GKB numaralarının bakiyelerini &quot;transit mallar&quot; şemasına göre kontrol et</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Kiểm soát số dư của số TKHQ khi mua từ nhà cung cấp theo sơ đồ &quot;hàng đi đường&quot;</value>
  </synonym>
  <location>Constant.ControlRemainingGTDUponPurchaseOfSupplierAccordingToSchemeProductsOnWay</location>
  <privilegedGetMode>true</privilegedGetMode>
</mdclass:FunctionalOption>
